  "head": [
   "Whenever there are communications and any AO or DO variable is modified, the control for these",
   "variables will only be via communications. They cannot be modified from the thermostat or the YKtool.",
   "The DO-2 (CMD_DO_002) variable permits a reset via communications of an alarm, provided that the",
   "cause that triggered the alarm has disappeared. The variable should be set to the value 0 (OFF) and",
   "after 5 seconds, it can be turned back to 1 (ON). The default setting of this variable is always 1. If the",
   "value 0 is selected permanently, the machine will always be in OFF mode.",
